; ABNF mirror (descriptive, not test-parsed — the real byte-level walker is
; ../📡️.protocol.semio, walked by dsl::walk_protocol) for s.stdio.semio.video diff
; (binary) — REAL binary diff frame (video wave, replacing the old print_diff().into_bytes()
; text-as-binary shortcut).
document  = format presence payload
format    = OCTET      ; DIFF_BINARY_FORMAT, currently 1
presence  = OCTET      ; bit0 = streams present
payload   = *OCTET     ; present iff (presence & 1) != 0 — varint length + enc_streams_diff text, see ../🦀️.rs
